# The largest of three numbers, with a phrase of our own.
# expect "max of 3 and 8" is the larger of 3 and 8
to the biggest of (a), (b) and (c):
    best = a
    if b > best:
        best = b
    if c > best:
        best = c
    give back best
show the biggest of 4, 9 and 2
show the max of 3 and 8
